#: scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c5f629bd24dc7e6854aa3703f1d44eca83103de3008ddb5d31fe08676030e50f
#. default-sha256: cbfcd17066294cf566ef03bce031a5fdb692fb732e6a80c0aeede54f1a993309
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EF1A17E8_E766_4047_942C_3956E1C7BE73"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Master, ⟪k:31⟫"
"Master... ⟪k:32⟫Please, wake up... ⟪k:33⟫Return to me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫Mestre, ⟪k:31⟫"
"Mestre... ⟪k:32⟫Por favor, acorde...⟪k:33⟫Volte para mim."

#: scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6271ca984421636cbe5b404ffde12be8e065fe37791a8caf9ec83c97b9d28abf
#. default-sha256: a5c9fca663ace2524db4d4375b459ae7784b85ec56a310aaaf02a21ab92cc1ce
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_503D27F7_8B5F_43A6_939E_1AA8BB215BAB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, have you come to, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Ahh, voltou a si, Mestre?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43821b80eb3792fe50ee202397c1b4ae715ab1d007511e7fe855ab7622b60b28
#. default-sha256: 598a467a3f4c97ee4ea2462f7756e21106a9b4ca5a6eeba8b8bfeaa4430fdd57
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B6BED36E_D636_466F_9CB0_E46702883FBB"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫I apologize for sending you through the door without warning. ⟪k:2⟫It must have "
"given you quite the scare."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hehe... ⟪k:1⟫Peço desculpas por mandá-lo pela porta sem aviso prévio. ⟪k:2⟫Deve ter lhe dado "
"um baita susto."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed90828d43f4df8277ac702e845e63c8a05f131eb87dd33646bda9e897822fb4
#. default-sha256: dca95aa05b518d3a7f51e6f8222085af2dc915460d641081b5329ca9dbf474c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F4926009_F4AB_479C_B9E1_F997361B0A47"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But I beg your forgiveness. ⟪k:1⟫I heard a terrible screaming from down the stairs, and I "
"panicked."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas eu imploro seu perdão. ⟪k:1⟫Eu ouvi um grito terrível lá de baixo das escadas e entrei "
"em pânico."

#: scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6963a4085daf54df6316018cae99ede2595a4b83729df7163f665eea9ceb8da6
#. default-sha256: 6b517f2575261a545ee0ad3781a86edb7178c35c69a0c474a6ab0a5036740624
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_4829A852_0DB6_42A3_A350_3736771CD151"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫You say you saw the White-Haired Girl? ⟪k:1⟫I see, so you made it into the world beyond the "
"door before me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você disse que viu a Garota de Cabelos Brancos? ⟪k:1⟫Entendo, então você entrou no mundo "
"além da porta antes de mim."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47450a6213b941a1da0aa919e10933b4fa114b9cbcd537bfdf2b4d4a5223436e
#. default-sha256: 847a4ea81ba28eeebab9ae8518ef2423b89f567264e8c691b54a36bd184a39bc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE8E1503_DC64_4929_80B3_3ECAA6DED4C2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I am deeply relieved that I was able to take your hand before losing sight of you."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Estou profundamente aliviada por ter conseguido segurar sua mão antes de perdê-lo de vista."

#: scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e1697bca695ed6180483cd1ceda2c726b0ce289a8f1881bc1fd785a09056163a
#. default-sha256: 37c60fe22df8413995745cf5537c2cb88c62a8d924232e7197d657c6ce3462a4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A89676AB_8E73_4969_BFD6_ECF5DFBA303F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I presume you have already grown familiar with the atmosphere of this time period, Master?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Presumo que você já se familiarizou com a atmosfera deste período do tempo, Mestre?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c0b9395748ed4c84e5458fc4285cfeb5fd911a179b66dc56d8300e66a70c186
#. default-sha256: 2d9c8d21f08517499ab3b69f0e3bef952f4e08d4aca9dc11a538534ccf532209
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DC3DF9C7_9FBF_40AE_988A_CE94D3BAA312"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you have seen her, as you said, then you should have a basic grasp of the situation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se você a viu, como disse, deve ter uma noção básica da situação."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 96423d16e446c0ef1afd6a43ff43946a3c5df9553645c71e9d72874899b68abf
#. default-sha256: 1ec81968b54c57a1bdbeef8de3efb60e3cfea6c1553721601c3666957c076c29
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B0DE5C00_C06F_41F7_84D9_244D3E94237F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was a very misfortunate girl in this era, accused of being a witch, abused and "
"persecuted. ⟪k:1⟫Her life was in constant danger."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela era uma menina muito desafortunada nesta época, acusada de ser uma bruxa, abusada e "
"perseguida. ⟪k:1⟫Sua vida estava em constante perigo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 462bf9889cbaf01ce80489e3d7cc45914c5b27c5ecddca3644c0f35ffb9044fa
#. default-sha256: bd3b7f3fee6b37909a2cf96796d731714c0f972b1ae3ae27bc5f8e2c04a3fc70
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5B14F580_3322_4667_81E2_C62F6B032F8B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was, again, her appearance that brought this upon her.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫That snow-white hair and "
"those ruby-red eyes⟪k:3⟫clearly differentiated her from everyone else."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Foi, novamente, sua aparência que provocou isso.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esse cabelo branco como a neve e "
"esses olhos vermelho-rubi⟪k:3⟫claramente a diferenciava de todos os outros."

#: scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 38eaf2fd830eabb7bf2f5d7a08f06b59ac3f4c7e1fa06503f75f39609c24abbc
#. default-sha256: 74798b945667efca349cb1bfcc49a385f437fc8837625ca3b6572db6d07ddf0b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_216105B8_88CE_4A72_8B7B_472E05F650C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Oh, and I apologize.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I neglected to mention that this door is... ⟪k:3⟫unique."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ah, e eu peço desculpas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Esqueci de mencionar que esta porta é...⟪k:3⟫única."

#: scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7691b55aec77ee3f4bc530d698d9e9feff3d74e569e0770b186e105a043bb757
#. default-sha256: 82768c30fffa6a45048667223607e2d09bd307ef689976c7909d29d9f99e665c
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_65367644_11A3_4D7F_86E4_F52198CE1EB5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As for ⟪k:1⟫what⟪k:2⟫ sets it apart... ⟪k:3⟫that will be made clear as we proceed, though "
"one difference is in the time period."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quanto a ⟪k:1⟫o que⟪k:2⟫ a diferencia...⟪k:3⟫isso ficará claro à medida que prosseguirmos, "
"embora uma diferença esteja no período de tempo."

#: scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5f0a4e2bfc93da58f1eb4fb518d12552dfc622d25a32922dc5bfa9d6bd32abf0
#. default-sha256: 6201deae840b678934d9e1d4b0bbdfe6fbc820337def362da56d94449782bf5f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_39697E4D_326A_4396_A090_794433BA31D1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The tales I have shown you began with that of the beautiful flaxen-haired family, followed "
"by the tale of the bloodthirsty beast, and then the tale of steel and ambition—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫As histórias que lhe mostrei começaram com a da bela família de cabelos linho, seguida pela "
"história da fera sanguinária, e depois pela história de aço e ambição—"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a63eaf918f7bafcc770ad5d695dfddf1cbfbd50c6420c058d86b31ed98796c9d
#. default-sha256: 7de4733a6fe1a5b06c25446055800e8df1947b03110035377843cb43f352b0ae
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D8B7DF58_C837_4E48_9E3D_AF6E8C6DF8CE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫proceeding in chronological order."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫prosseguindo em ordem cronológica."

#: scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9280891079d95084d89bf16084a2be9a34598eb6edb7241efe0b845ac9f1e3a1
#. default-sha256: 4f75c52830b9f0e66ff4f464677e09ab4d3d97db4495bb828de162aeca5e5851
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C7067907_DA0C_4EB9_8D7D_6640B2D55A9B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, the door we have just entered takes us to the period now known as the Middle Ages—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫long, long before the other three tales."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, a porta que acabamos de entrar nos leva ao período agora conhecido como Idade "
"Média—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫muito, muito antes dos outros três contos."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1625d64d023a3f7fc2d24e217643fd7775ec6961a424389d6003b19cf9a42e81
#. default-sha256: c2edad6b2f640fc52a47d4272c3fb3473c1535c274784cd5e3167ce9bd7596ac
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_F51BB548_F386_48E9_8932_FEEBFC358CEB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Yes, that is correct—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫this is where it all began."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sim, está correto—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫é aqui onde tudo começou."

#: scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 970562d33b5a1c538f8ff46ac12cadcbed5e0da185d90b749d0d5209a9f54b02
#. default-sha256: d5dc9ef78af76b321f378a8cf8c55f8bea74d5891fa2cfe8a0c7ade34755b343
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B080792D_0CD8_44B3_8B25_6D9B097B6DDA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The mansion’s curse, the truth of the witch, and Your identity—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫all of this should "
"be made known."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A maldição da mansão, a verdade da bruxa e Sua identidade—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫tudo isso deve ser "
"trazido a luz."

#: scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2bee6cf6bb127e1fca16242844620d1a6e70b7e3bc27268d47cc90c896f2b319
#. default-sha256: 0944f760898aef926eef5e65d2f1c2801f15aa0e0d6728b1cf9e5298afacbf19
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FD5932F4_9DF0_4A24_A415_6821C45C5F28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If, after this tale, you are still unable to reclaim your old self..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Se, depois desta história, você ainda não conseguir recuperar seu antigo eu..."

#: scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ff6eb9a209324035e405e000ff2f927acdc605651dd3ad18bb8f4944ab285be
#. default-sha256: 1a80bf158ac689336f9d2586437913ea319474ac1db20855b766e57f7d23b21b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7014308B_F4B1_447F_9CB7_5CA77E0FF0E8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫then there is nothing more I can do."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫então não há mais nada que eu possa fazer."

#: scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6b4bc0b0aafb965d9c3af2dae12546ef824d8262133e23816c0f38e57fb71238
#. default-sha256: f5ed7b78a2a2f172af04fc6ce11c3194ae81007f04476d1a841269363bdf5ba6
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_9E0F62D7_DFFD_4981_8761_35EF94496288"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This door contains the last tale I am able to tell you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Esta porta contém a última história que sou capaz de lhe contar."

#: scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f98dfbefa161e1f8e186903a0a656967eb28ae6e0cdaa5a6ca724cf7a635074
#. default-sha256: 85aaf7828b0ca12dfa1e789b8166fdd923d105d3bb84a20333f88eafb9dcd256
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_88E14716_86DD_462E_B6F6_C4834BBED190"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So I ask of you, please do not let go of my hand until it is all over."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então eu peço a você, por favor, não solte minha mão até que tudo acabe."

#: scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cbd5518467b21a961f93d094f51907446bce274c73ef143641814e4560ea4ad
#. default-sha256: 36a90c236a75f95cac7c99a33fa0a59bd37c93e7594cc9ae84f5b14971428c2e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AC56C405_318B_451F_8F8C_D053D0AA1B11"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now then... ⟪k:1⟫let us begin a beautiful, tragic love story of two solitary souls trapped "
"in a mansion of darkness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agora, então...⟪k:1⟫vamos começar uma bela e trágica história de amor de duas almas "
"solitárias presas em uma mansão de escuridão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac9bd43809e563f3d217174a6669790eec4cd0796ed4c85b1e06d4391ae261c0
#. default-sha256: 9e70e296ea89cf0ad22c7debc244a760027a326408c3431bf34e29851e6f7e3f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_CE1D801E_A386_4F81_80B7_82F1195D43E0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“In that era, the mansion was a dungeon draped in darkness.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫“Naquela época, a mansão era uma masmorra envolta em escuridão.”"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebd23d1e9f030e2e963487d4dd745916de0487f796712e79c9a8083bbcd2df3f
#. default-sha256: 60d68e281dd902d73e7923b1782677e3c450343b6faf0a85ef8389a5d3801f24
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E35BAA66_2050_4774_B272_0FCB6FDE5585"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"After a great deal of time on the run, the White-Haired Girl found herself at a remote mansion "
"that stood in a dark, overgrown forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
