msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫All the windows were either boarded or shuttered, and it was even darker inside the house "
"than out. ⟪k:1⟫Not even a ray of moonlight could enter those walls."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Todas as janelas estavam fechadas com tábuas ou venezianas, e era ainda mais escuro dentro "
"da casa do que fora. ⟪k:1⟫Nem mesmo um raio de luar poderia entrar naquelas paredes."

