msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a young man named Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Though she could not make out the details of his face "
"in the candlelight, she thought him a very handsome man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Era um jovem chamado Michel. ⟪k:1⟫Embora ela não conseguisse distinguir os detalhes de seu "
"rosto à luz da vela, ela o achava um homem muito bonito."

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
