msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D06033B_76FB_4AD6_B6E2_689D1E6CB834"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, he proclaimed to her that a witch resided within the mansion, and that he too was "
"cursed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, ele proclamou a ela que uma bruxa residia dentro da mansão, e que ele também era "
"amaldiçoado."

#: scenario4:scenario4_F97B061F_C94C_4E47_9083_4DF3A43CF7F4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 07e1963290d68ede23ac37a97a9b7223bc31405836a1aaeb113b70031f6f8a5c
