msgid "⟪k:0⟫Everyone who got close to him lost their lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Todos que se aproximaram dele perderam a vida."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D46E1850_A638_4423_8478_E8299693BAC6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
