msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do you think that what he told her was all nonsense?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A lie devised to chase her out "
"of the house?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Você acha que o que ele disse a ela era tudo bobagem?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Uma mentira inventada para "
"expulsá-la da casa?"

#: scenario4:scenario4_887E6F9E_D819_4002_A13F_1F6FE4BFC4CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
