msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Despite Michel’s assertions, the White-Haired Girl decided she would take up "
"residence within the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Apesar das afirmações de Michel, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos decidiu que iria "
"morar na mansão."

#: scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
