msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This era’s White-Haired Girl was younger than the others; ⟪k:1⟫she was still in her early "
"teens, young enough to be seen as still a child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A Garota de Cabelos Brancos desta época era mais jovem que as outras; ⟪k:1⟫ela ainda estava "
"no início da adolescência, jovem o suficiente para ainda ser vista como uma criança."

#: scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe8d573f2dd373e3be8081bb3546152320a69563ce5dbc94f52603b41cec7a42
