"⟪k:0⟫Um... ⟪k:1⟫is there anything I can do to help?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I will clean or cook or do anything—"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫just let me know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Hum...⟪k:1⟫há algo que eu possa fazer para ajudar?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Vou limpar ou cozinhar ou fazer "
"qualquer coisa—⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫é só me dizer."

