"⟪k:0⟫Michel was not, I believe, spurning her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was merely disinterested. ⟪k:3⟫He did "
"not treat her disrespectfully, nor did he seem averse to her presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel não estava, creio eu, tratando-a com desprezo—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ele estava apenas "
"desinteressado. ⟪k:3⟫Ele não a tratou desrespeitosamente, nem parecia avesso à sua presença."

