msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_75D69473_E7A3_4283_822D_A10B509FD98E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫A single volume took an incredible amount of work to create.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Even the process of "
"binding was an art."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um único volume exigia uma quantidade incrível de trabalho para ser criado.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Até o "
"processo de encadernação era uma arte."

#: scenario4:scenario4_177E4BD3_3738_4A48_B4A5_4C3CF85F079D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
